% 01_o_sanctissima.gmn -- audible test: the opening phrase of "O
% Sanctissima" in D major, the exact worked example GUIDO Music
% Notation's own Wikipedia article uses to introduce the format --
% exercises tag headers, octave/duration sticking, dots, and bar lines.
[ \clef<"treble"> \key<"D"> \meter<"4/4">
  a1*1/2 b a/4. g/8 f#/4 g a/2 b a/4. g/8 f#/4 g
  a/2 a b c#2/4 d c#/2 b1 a/1 ]
